3
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.280
A new version of an open source library

4
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:11.200
created after their training run, the

5
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:13.599
way your team decided how to use a

6
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.920
certain framework, or the broader

7
00:00:13.599 --> 00:00:17.920
