27
00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.840
needs and isn't in your code. This

28
00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:10.720
ranges from instructions and examples

29
00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:13.439
for using open source libraries through

30
00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:15.520
